---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/okad-house.css';
---

<Base title="OKAD vs Vidico: Video Ad Agency Comparison (2026)" description="Compare OKAD and Vidico for video ad production. Side-by-side on pricing, turnaround, UGC creators, and creative testing.">
  <div class="okh">

    <section class="khero" style="padding: 80px 0 48px">
      <div class="w" style="max-width:900px">
        <span class="kick">OKAD vs Vidico</span>
        <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);margin-bottom:16px">OKAD vs Vidico — <span class="cap">Which Is Right for You?</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">Two agencies, two approaches to video. One builds ads engineered for performance testing; the other produces premium brand films. Here's how they compare so you can pick the right fit.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:16px">Side-by-side comparison</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="cmp-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th></th>
              <th>OKAD</th>
              <th>Vidico</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Focus</td>
              <td class="highlight">Full-service creative testing</td>
              <td>Video production studio</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Pricing</td>
              <td class="highlight">From $500 / 10 videos</td>
              <td>Custom quotes ($5K+)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Turnaround</td>
              <td class="highlight">5 business days</td>
              <td>2–4 weeks</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>UGC Creators</td>
              <td class="highlight">600+ vetted creators</td>
              <td>Partner network</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Creative Testing</td>
              <td class="highlight">Built-in testing framework</td>
              <td>No testing included</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Platforms</td>
              <td>Meta, TikTok, YouTube</td>
              <td>All platforms</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Team Location</td>
              <td>Portugal (US timezone overlap)</td>
              <td>Australia + global</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:16px">When to choose OKAD</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:16px">OKAD is the better fit if you're a DTC or e-commerce brand that needs to test a high volume of creative concepts quickly. The model is built around iteration: shoot 10 ad variations, test them on real spend, kill the losers, scale the winners, and repeat.</p>
      <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:24px;display:grid;gap:10px;color:var(--soft, #4d4d49)">
        <li>You need 10–50 ad variations per month, not one hero video.</li>
        <li>You want strategy, scripting, production, and testing from one team.</li>
        <li>You're optimizing for ROAS and need data-driven creative decisions.</li>
        <li>You want a fast turnaround so you can iterate weekly.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:16px">When to choose Vidico</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:16px">Vidico is the better choice when you need a polished brand film, a product launch video, or high-end explainer content. Their strength is cinematic production quality and storytelling.</p>
      <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:24px;display:grid;gap:10px;color:var(--soft, #4d4d49)">
        <li>You need a single high-production brand video or product film.</li>
        <li>Your priority is production value over iteration speed.</li>
        <li>You have a larger budget and a longer timeline.</li>
        <li>You want a studio-grade look with professional actors and sets.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px">
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);margin-bottom:24px">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details>
          <summary>Is OKAD cheaper than Vidico?</summary>
          <p>Yes, significantly. OKAD's batch model starts at $500 for 10 videos, while Vidico's custom projects typically start at $5,000 and up. The difference reflects the production style: OKAD optimizes for volume testing, Vidico for premium single-asset production.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can Vidico do UGC-style ads?</summary>
          <p>Vidico can incorporate UGC elements, but it's not their core model. They work through partner networks rather than maintaining a dedicated creator roster. OKAD has 600+ vetted UGC creators ready to shoot within days.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Which agency is better for Meta and TikTok ads?</summary>
          <p>OKAD is purpose-built for paid social ads on Meta, TikTok, and YouTube. The entire workflow — scripts, creators, editing, and testing — is designed around what performs on these platforms. Vidico produces content that can run on any platform but doesn't specialize in performance optimization.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do either agency offer creative strategy?</summary>
          <p>OKAD includes creative strategy and a testing framework as part of every engagement. You get data on what hooks, angles, and formats work best for your brand. Vidico focuses on production execution — strategy and media buying are typically handled by the brand or a separate agency.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="background:var(--stage, #111);padding:80px 24px;text-align:center">
      <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto">
        <h2 style="color:#fff;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:16px">Ready to test?</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--stage-soft, #8e8e8e);margin-bottom:32px">Get 10 video ads in 5 days. We handle strategy, creators, editing, and testing — you see what scales.</p>
        <a class="btn dew" href="https://calendly.com/okad_calls/first" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a free strategy call</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is OKAD cheaper than Vidico?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, significantly. OKAD's batch model starts at $500 for 10 videos, while Vidico's custom projects typically start at $5,000 and up. The difference reflects the production style: OKAD optimizes for volume testing, Vidico for premium single-asset production."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can Vidico do UGC-style ads?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Vidico can incorporate UGC elements, but it's not their core model. They work through partner networks rather than maintaining a dedicated creator roster. OKAD has 600+ vetted UGC creators ready to shoot within days."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which agency is better for Meta and TikTok ads?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "OKAD is purpose-built for paid social ads on Meta, TikTok, and YouTube. The entire workflow — scripts, creators, editing, and testing — is designed around what performs on these platforms. Vidico produces content that can run on any platform but doesn't specialize in performance optimization."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do either agency offer creative strategy?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "OKAD includes creative strategy and a testing framework as part of every engagement. You get data on what hooks, angles, and formats work best for your brand. Vidico focuses on production execution — strategy and media buying are typically handled by the brand or a separate agency."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <style>
    .cmp-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 32px 0; }
    .cmp-table th, .cmp-table td { padding: 16px 20px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule, #e6e6e6); font-size: 15px; }
    .cmp-table th { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink, #111); background: var(--card, #f2f2f2); }
    .cmp-table td:first-child { font-weight: 500; color: var(--soft, #8e8e8e); width: 140px; }
    .cmp-table .highlight { background: #f4f9e8; }
    .faq-list { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .faq-list details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule, #e6e6e6); padding-bottom: 12px; }
    .faq-list summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; padding: 8px 0; color: var(--ink, #111); }
    .faq-list details p { padding: 8px 0 4px; color: var(--soft, #4d4d49); line-height: 1.6; }
  </style>
</Base>
